    "Each case starts from a fresh state (mp_pets_from_bytes(NULL, 0)) and runs its steps in order on one handle.",
    "at = [mono_ms, local day index, local minute of the day] (MPPetsClock).",
    "decide: appear | commit | idle | tap | hold | seat | drop | disappear (pet for the touches, graphemes for commit).",
    "ambience: fields that differ from ambience_default (MPPetsAmbience; flags named as below).",
    "expect: null for no plan, otherwise every MPPetsPlan field. Tokens count from 1 per handle.",
    "resolve: a token, with outcome completed | interrupted | cancelled; reward is the who bits (1 Mimimo, 2 Momo).",
    "check: values of the persisted state after the step (spontaneous today, plays and pets per cat [mimimo, momo], graphemes, greeted)."
